      "content": "# Phase 1 — Discovery\n\nKey terms parsed from the task:\n- \"student\", \"full name\", \"email address\", \"student year 'G'\" → student directory\n- \"department is degree-granting\", \"department full name\" → department dimension\n- \"school in which their department offers subjects\" → subject offering tables with school attribution\n- \"at least one required material\" → course material programs (TIP 'RQ' / library 'Y')\n- \"library subject offerings\", \"minimum number of enrolled students\" → LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED\n- \"total number of units for those subjects\" → unit columns\n\nFrom the two broad semantic searches (topk=50, all types), surviving entities (score > 0.5 or clear keyword match):\n\n**Tables**: `MIT_STUDENT_DIRECTORY`, `SIS_DEPARTMENT`, `STUDENT_DEPARTMENT`, `LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED`, `LIBRARY_RESERVE_MATRL_DETAIL`, `LIBRARY_MATERIAL_STATUS`, `TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED`, `TIP_DETAIL`, `TIP_MATERIAL_STATUS`, `SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY`, `SUBJECT_SUMMARY`, `COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED`, `SIS_SUBJECT_CODE`\n\n**Metrics (precedents)**: `dw_1033`, `dw_1350`, `dw_4724`, `dw_3393`, `dw_3911`, `dw_1212`, `dw_3237`, `dw_3684`, `dw_1474`\n\n**Concepts**: `concept_person_directory`, `concept_department_dimension`, `concept_subject_offering_facts`, `concept_course_material_programs`\n\n**Column Concepts**: `column_concept_enrollment_measures`, `column_concept_total_units`, `column_concept_material_status_key`, `column_concept_department_name`, `column_concept_subject_id`, `column_concept_term_code`\n\n# Phase 2 — Investigation\n\nFetching full details of the core entities:\n\n",
      "tool_calls": [
